ain of the story was  actually the hero he not only makes the  best out of his last few days on Earth  but also manages to inspire his students  to be a better person  several years later Nagisa has finally  found his goal and decides to become a  teacher for delinquents  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching
 

